      "summaries": {
        "en": "Beads is a memory upgrade for coding agents, solving the problem of agents forgetting context across sessions. It uses a persistent, structured memory store that agents can read and write, enabling long-term project awareness. Technically, it integrates via a simple API, allowing agents like Claude Code to recall past decisions and code changes. You can use it to give your coding agent continuity, making it more effective on large, ongoing projects.",
        "zh": "Beads 是一个为编程智能体提供持久记忆的开源工具，解决了智能体在跨会话中丢失上下文的问题。它通过一个结构化的持久化存储，让智能体能够读写长期记忆，从而保持对项目的持续理解。技术亮点在于其简洁的 API 设计，可以轻松集成到 Claude Code 等编码代理中，使它们能记住之前的决策和代码修改。你可以用它来增强自己的编码助手，让它在大型、持续的项目中表现更连贯、更高效。",
        "es": "Beads is a memory upgrade for coding agents, solving the problem of agents forgetting context across sessions. It uses a persistent, structured memory store that agents can read and write, enabling long-term project awareness. Technically, it integrates via a simple API, allowing agents like Claude Code to recall past decisions and code changes. You can use it to give your coding agent continuity, making it more effective on large, ongoing projects.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "beads stands out for agents, claude-code, and coding in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Beads is a memory upgrade for coding agents, solving the problem of agents forgetting context across sessions. It uses a persistent, structured memory store that agents can read and write, enabling long-term project awareness. Technically, it integrates via a simple API, allowing agents like Claude Code to recall past decisions and code changes. You can use it to give your coding agent continuity, making it more effective on large, ongoing projects.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/gastownhall/beads for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
